# --- third-party literature ---
# Other people's papers and books are Library/ content, not manuscript source.
# They stay on disk and in the Nextcloud mirror; they are not tracked here,
# so this repository's history stays text-only.
Material/
material/

# --- built documents ---
# Regenerable from source; a tracked PDF turns every rebuild into a diff.
book.pdf

# --- PDFs ---
# Other people's papers, and built or exported documents. They stay on disk and
# in the Nextcloud mirror; git here tracks text. Books/PlasmaVI is the exception
# — its PDFs are figures, i.e. manuscript source — and has its own .gitignore.
*.pdf

# --- Jupyter notebooks ---
# Committed notebooks carry megabytes of embedded output and diff as one blob.
# These are pending a refactor; see ~/Research/Tasks/.
*.ipynb

# --- repository-specific ---
.luarc.json
_chapters
packt
Manifest.toml
/src/images/*.png
